<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
<title>智能交通管理系统 · 答辩演示</title>
<style>
:root {
  --ink: #0F172A; --navy: #1E293B; --blue: #1E40AF; --blueLt: #3B82F6;
  --sky: #0EA5E9; --green: #10B981; --red: #EF4444; --yellow: #F59E0B;
  --purple: #8B5CF6; --surface: #F8FAFC; --border: #E2E8F0; --muted: #64748B; --white: #FFFFFF;
  --font-h: "Microsoft YaHei","PingFang SC","Hiragino Sans GB",system-ui,sans-serif;
  --font-mono: "JetBrains Mono",Consolas,"Courier New",monospace;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
html, body { height: 100%; background: #0a0e1a; font-family: var(--font-h); color: var(--ink); overflow: hidden; }
.stage { position: fixed; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.deck { width: min(96vw, calc(96vh * 16 / 9)); aspect-ratio: 16/9; position: relative; background: var(--surface); border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.5); overflow: hidden; }
.slide { position: absolute; inset: 0; padding: 50px 60px; display: none; opacity: 0; transition: opacity .35s ease; }
.slide.active { display: block; opacity: 1; }
.slide.dark { background: var(--ink); color: var(--white); }
.hud { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 4px; background: var(--blue); z-index: 10; }
.hud-foot { position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 4px; background: var(--border); z-index: 10; }
.hud-info { position: absolute; bottom: 14px; left: 30px; right: 30px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); z-index: 11; }
.slide.dark .hud-info { color: #475569; }
.kicker { font-size: 12px; color: var(--blue); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.slide.dark .kicker { color: #93C5FD; }
.title { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 22px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
.slide.dark .title { color: var(--white); }
.card { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; }
.card.dark { background: var(--navy); border-color: transparent; color: var(--white); }
.card.dark .muted { color: #94A3B8; }
.muted { color: var(--muted); }
.mono { font-family: var(--font-mono); }
.row { display: flex; gap: 16px; }
.col { flex: 1; }
.chip { display: inline-block; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: white; background: var(--blue); }
.chip.sky { background: var(--sky); } .chip.green { background: var(--green); } .chip.red { background: var(--red); } .chip.yellow { background: var(--yellow); } .chip.purple { background: var(--purple); } .chip.ink { background: var(--ink); }
.dot { display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--blue); vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 6px; }
.dot.green { background: var(--green); } .dot.red { background: var(--red); } .dot.yellow { background: var(--yellow); }
ul.clean { list-style: none; }
table.matrix { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 11px; }
table.matrix th, table.matrix td { padding: 8px 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border); text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; }
table.matrix th { background: var(--ink); color: white; }
table.matrix tr:nth-child(even) td { background: rgba(0,0,0,.02); }
table.matrix td:first-child, table.matrix th:first-child { text-align: left; font-weight: 700; }
table.matrix td:last-child { color: var(--green); font-weight: 700; }
.callout { border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 14px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
.callout.blue { background: #EFF6FF; color: var(--blue); }
.callout.green { background: #ECFDF5; color: #065F46; }
.callout.yellow { background: #FEF3C7; color: #92400E; }
.callout.dark { background: var(--navy); color: var(--white); }
.stat { text-align: center; padding: 12px 8px; }
.stat .v { font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; }
.stat .u { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 4px; }
.stat .t { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8px; }
.stat .d { font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; }
.cover-title { font-size: 64px; font-weight: 800; color: white; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: 4px; }
.cover-sub { font-size: 30px; color: #93C5FD; margin-top: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
.thx { font-size: 120px; font-weight: 800; color: white; letter-spacing: 16px; text-align: center; }
.thx-sub { font-size: 30px; color: #93C5FD; text-align: center; margin-top: 20px; }
.kbd-hint { position: fixed; bottom: 14px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); background: rgba(0,0,0,.7); color: white; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 11px; z-index: 100; pointer-events: none; opacity: 0; transition: opacity .3s; }
.kbd-hint.show { opacity: 1; }
.kbd-hint kbd { background: rgba(255,255,255,.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: var(--font-mono); margin: 0 2px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="stage">
<div class="deck" id="deck">
<div class="hud"></div>
<div class="hud-foot"></div>
<div class="hud-info"><span>智能交通管理系统 · 答辩</span><span id="page-info">1 / 22</span></div>

<section class="slide dark active">
  <div style="padding:30px 0;">
    <span style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#EF4444;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px;"></span>
    <span style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#F59E0B;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px;"></span>
    <span style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#10B981;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px;"></span>
    <span style="margin-left:14px;color:#94A3B8;letter-spacing:4px;font-size:13px;">TRAFFIC · AI · REALTIME</span>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top:80px;padding-left:40px;">
    <div class="cover-title">智能交通管理系统</div>
    <div class="cover-sub">AI 驱动的动态红绿灯调度系统</div>
    <div style="margin-top:36px;">
      <span class="chip" style="margin-right:10px;">LLM-as-Policy 信号策略</span>
      <span class="chip sky" style="margin-right:10px;">自适应 + 规则 三模式协同</span>
      <span class="chip red" style="margin-right:10px;">紧急车辆优先通行</span>
      <span class="chip green">实时可视化</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="position:absolute;bottom:60px;left:60px;right:60px;color:#94A3B8;font-size:14px;">
    答辩人：________________   ·   学号：________________   ·   课程：科学研究与创新<br>
    指导教师：________________   ·   日期：2026.06
  </div>
</section>

<section class="slide">
  <div class="kicker">CONTENTS</div>
  <div class="title">目录 · Outline</div>
  <div style="margin-top:30px;">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;padding:14px 0;">
      <div style="width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;background:#1E40AF;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;font-family:Calibri;">01</div>
      <div style="margin-left:24px;">
        <div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;">研究背景与问题</div>
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;">为什么需要动态红绿灯</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;padding:14px 0;">
      <div style="width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;background:#0EA5E9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;font-family:Calibri;">02</div>
      <div style="margin-left:24px;">
        <div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;">现有方案分析</div>
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;">传统配时 vs 自适应 vs AI 策略</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;padding:14px 0;">
      <div style="width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;background:#10B981;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;font-family:Calibri;">03</div>
      <div style="margin-left:24px;">
        <div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;">系统总体设计</div>
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;">架构图 + 技术栈 + 模块划分</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;padding:14px 0;">
      <div style="width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;background:#F59E0B;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;font-family:Calibri;">04</div>
      <div style="margin-left:24px;">
        <div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;">核心模块实现</div>
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;">仿真 / 自适应 / AI / 紧急 / 可视化</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;padding:14px 0;">
      <div style="width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;background:#EF4444;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;font-family:Calibri;">05</div>
      <div style="margin-left:24px;">
        <div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;">演示与效果</div>
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;">关键场景回放 + 性能指标</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;padding:14px 0;">
      <div style="width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;background:#8B5CF6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;font-family:Calibri;">06</div>
      <div style="margin-left:24px;">
        <div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;">实用性 · 可行性 · 创新点</div>
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;">答辩三大重点回应</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="slide">
  <div class="kicker">01 · BACKGROUND</div>
  <div class="title">研究背景：城市交通拥堵已成系统性问题</div>
  <div class="row" style="margin-top:18px;">
    <div class="card" style="flex:0 0 38%;background:var(--ink);color:white;">
      <div style="color:#93C5FD;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;">城市路口通行</div>
      <div style="font-size:84px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;margin:8px 0;">60%</div>
      <div style="color:#CBD5E1;font-size:13px;">的延误由信号配时不优造成</div>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid #334155;margin:14px 0;padding-top:14px;">
        <div><span style="color:var(--red);font-weight:800;">· </span><span style="color:#E2E8F0;">潮汐现象明显</span></div>
        <div style="margin-top:6px;"><span style="color:var(--red);font-weight:800;">· </span><span style="color:#E2E8F0;">高峰 / 平峰差距大</span></div>
        <div style="margin-top:6px;"><span style="color:var(--red);font-weight:800;">· </span><span style="color:#E2E8F0;">固定配时无法适应实时车流</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="card" style="flex:1;">
          <div style="height:6px;width:30px;background:#EF4444;border-radius:3px;margin-bottom:10px;"></div>
          <div style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;">固定配时</div>
          <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:6px;">Webster / 手工经验，分时段粗粒度，无法秒级响应</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="flex:1;">
          <div style="height:6px;width:30px;background:#F59E0B;border-radius:3px;margin-bottom:10px;"></div>
          <div style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;">潮汐失衡</div>
          <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:6px;">早高峰东西向 / 晚高峰南北向，倒灌式拥堵</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row" style="margin-top:14px;">
        <div class="card" style="flex:1;">
          <div style="height:6px;width:30px;background:#8B5CF6;border-radius:3px;margin-bottom:10px;"></div>
          <div style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;">特殊事件</div>
          <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:6px;">救护车 / 消防车被红灯挡住，错过黄金时间</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="flex:1;">
          <div style="height:6px;width:30px;background:#1E40AF;border-radius:3px;margin-bottom:10px;"></div>
          <div style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;">运维成本</div>
          <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:6px;">人工调参依赖经验，新手难以胜任复杂路口</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="callout blue" style="margin-top:18px;">
        →  痛点根源：传统信号策略的「时空分辨率」不足，难以在秒级匹配真实车流
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="slide">
  <div class="kicker">02 · RELATED WORK</div>
  <div class="title">现有方案分析：从固定配时到 LLM-as-Policy</div>
  <div class="row" style="margin-top:8px;">
    <div style="flex:0 0 65%;">
      <table class="matrix">
        <thead><tr><th>方案</th><th>粒度</th><th>适应性</th><th>成本</th><th>代表系统</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>固定配时</td><td>粗(分时段)</td><td>无</td><td>低</td><td>Webster / 经验</td></tr>
          <tr><td>感应控制</td><td>中(车检器)</td><td>中</td><td>中</td><td>SCATS (澳)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>自适应协调</td><td>细(秒级)</td><td>中-高</td><td>高</td><td>SCOOT / RHODES</td></tr>
          <tr><td>强化学习</td><td>细(秒级)</td><td>高</td><td>高</td><td>PressLight / CoLight</td></tr>
          <tr><td>LLM-as-Policy</td><td>细 + 语义</td><td>高 + 灵活</td><td>中-低</td><td>本项目</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <div class="callout yellow" style="margin-top:14px;">
        →  LLM-as-Policy 不是替代 RL，而是在「数据稀缺 + 上线快」场景下的轻量替代方案
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card dark" style="flex:1;">
      <div style="color:#93C5FD;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:700;">OUR ANGLE</div>
      <div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin-top:4px;">差异化定位</div>
      <div style="height:2px;width:30px;background:var(--green);margin:8px 0 14px;"></div>
      <div style="display:flex;margin-bottom:10px;"><span class="dot green" style="margin-top:6px;"></span><div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;">语义推理</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#CBD5E1;">LLM 可理解「早高峰东向西倒灌」类语义上下文</div></div></div>
      <div style="display:flex;margin-bottom:10px;"><span class="dot green" style="margin-top:6px;"></span><div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;">零训练成本</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#CBD5E1;">复用通用大模型，不需仿真→训练→部署链路</div></div></div>
      <div style="display:flex;margin-bottom:10px;"><span class="dot green" style="margin-top:6px;"></span><div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;">约束可解释</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#CBD5E1;">Prompt 写明上下限与依据，比 RL 黑盒更易审计</div></div></div>
      <div style="display:flex;"><span class="dot green" style="margin-top:6px;"></span><div><div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;">云端接入</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#CBD5E1;">DeepSeek 为主、智谱 GLM 备选，成本可调</div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="slide">
  <div class="kicker">01 · PROBLEM</div>
  <div class="title">我们要解决的问题：三问三答</div>
  <div class="row" style="margin-top:24px;">
    <div class="card" style="flex:1;overflow:hidden;">
      <div style="background:#1E40AF;margin:-20px -20px 16px;padding:14px 20px;color:white;">
        <span style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;font-family:Calibri;">Q1</span>
        <span style="margin-left:14px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;opacity:.9;">QUESTION 01</span>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:17px;font-weight:700;min-height:90px;">能不能让信号自己看数据调时长？</div>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin:14px 0;"></div>
      <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;">我们的回答</div>
      <div style="font-size:36px;font-weight:800;color:#1E40AF;line-height:1;">能</div>
      <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:10px;">用 AI 周期读车流，给出绿灯建议；规则算法兜底</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="flex:1;overflow:hidden;">
      <div style="background:#10B981;margin:-20px -20px 16px;padding:14px 20px;color:white;">
        <span style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;font-family:Calibri;">Q2</span>
        <span style="margin-left:14px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;opacity:.9;">QUESTION 02</span>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:17px;font-weight:700;min-height:90px;">低峰时段能不能别空放绿灯？</div>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin:14px 0;"></div>
      <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;">我们的回答</div>
      <div style="font-size:36px;font-weight:800;color:#10B981;line-height:1;">能</div>
      <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:10px;">窗口阈值触发「低车流快速切绿」，加保底秒数避免抢断</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="flex:1;overflow:hidden;">
      <div style="background:#EF4444;margin:-20px -20px 16px;padding:14px 20px;color:white;">
        <span style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;font-family:Calibri;">Q3</span>
        <span style="margin-left:14px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;opacity:.9;">QUESTION 03</span>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:17px;font-weight:700;min-height:90px;">紧急车辆来了怎么办？</div>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin:14px 0;"></div>
      <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;">我们的回答</div>
      <div style="font-size:36px;font-weight:800;color:#EF4444;line-height:1;">能</div>
      <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:10px;">检测紧急状态 → 切相位给紧急方向 → 恢复时平滑降级</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="callout dark" style="margin-top:20px;">
    →  目标：让信号系统从「按表运行」升级为「按数据运行」，并保留人在环的兜底
  </div>
</section>


<section class="slide">
  <div class="kicker">HIGHLIGHTS · 创新点</div>
  <div class="title">创新点速览：四大可量化创新</div>
  <div class="row" style="margin-top:18px;">
    <div class="card" style="flex:1;">
      <div style="position:absolute;left:0;width:6px;height:100%;background:#1E40AF;border-radius:12px 0 0 12px;"></div>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;">
        <div style="font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#1E40AF;font-family:Calibri;">01</div>
        <div style="font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#1E40AF;font-weight:700;">INNOVATION</div>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin-top:8px;">LLM-as-Policy 信号策略</div>
      <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:8px;">首次将通用大模型作为路口配时策略生成器，支持语义上下文聚合与即时生效</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="flex:1;">
      <div style="position:absolute;left:0;width:6px;height:100%;background:#10B981;border-radius:12px 0 0 12px;"></div>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;">
        <div style="font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#10B981;font-family:Calibri;">02</div>
        <div style="font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#10B981;font-weight:700;">RESILIENCE</div>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin-top:8px;">三模式协同调度</div>
      <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:8px;">规则(兜底) + 自适应(秒级降级) + AI(高阶优化) 协同，任意一档故障不影响系统</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="row" style="margin-top:18px;">
    <div class="card" style="flex:1;">
      <div style="position:absolute;left:0;width:6px;height:100%;background:#0EA5E9;border-radius:12px 0 0 12px;"></div>
